step	1	2	Talking to Betty
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Betty</col> outside her home in <col=800000>Land's End</col>. She told me her father had been murdered and I offered to help investigate. To do so, I'll first need to get permission from <col=800000>Sergeant Hudson</col>, who is leading the investigation.</col>
step	2	3	Talking to Sergeant Hudson
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Betty</col> outside her home in <col=800000>Land's End</col>. She told me her father had been murdered and I offered to help investigate. I spoke to <col=800000>Sergeant Hudson</col> and he reluctantly agreed to let me help. I can now begin my investigation. If I need help, I might be able to get some advice from <col=800000>Sergeant Hudson</col> or one of his <col=800000>Corporals</col>.</col>
step	3	4	Starting the investigation
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Betty</col> outside her home in <col=800000>Land's End</col>. She told me her father had been murdered and I offered to help investigate. I spoke to <col=800000>Sergeant Hudson</col> and he reluctantly agreed to let me help. I started to investigate, but I suspect there's still more to uncover. I should examine the <col=800000>Body</col>, search the nearby area for <col=800000>Clues</col>, and question potential <col=800000>Witnesses</col>.</col>
step	4	6	After finding enough evidence about Betty's father
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Betty</col> outside her home in <col=800000>Land's End</col>. She told me her father had been murdered and I offered to help investigate. I spoke to <col=800000>Sergeant Hudson</col> and he reluctantly agreed to let me help. I examined the <col=800000>Body</col>, searched the nearby area for <col=800000>Clues</col>, and questioned potential <col=800000>Witnesses</col>. I should report back to <col=800000>Sergeant Hudson</col> and let him know what I've learnt.</col>
step	5	12	After telling Sergeant Hudson about the evidence
line	<str>I spoke to Betty outside her home in Land's End. She told me her father had been murdered and I offered to help investigate. I spoke to Sergeant Hudson and he reluctantly agreed to let me help. I examined the Body, searchd the nearby area for Clues, and questioned potential Witnesses.</str>
line	<col=000080>I completed my investigation and uncovered a few things of note. I reported these to <col=800000>Sergeant Hudson</col>. Having completed his own investigation, he departed, promising to be in touch once he had something to share. However, <col=800000>Betty</col> wasn't convinved and wanted us to continue investigating on our own. She asked me to meet her at her uncle's home north west of the <col=800000>Tithe Farm</col>, south of <col=800000>Hosidius</col>.</col>
step	6	14	Talking to Betty at her uncle's home
line	<str>I completed my investigation and uncovered a few things of note. I reported these to Sergeant Hudson. Having completed his own investigation, he departed, promising to be in touch once he had something to share. However, Betty wasn't convinved and wanted us to continue investigating on our own. She asked me to meet her at her uncle's home north west of the Tithe Farm, south of Hosidius.</str>
line	<col=000080>At <col=800000>Betty's</col> request, I met her at her uncle's home north west of the <col=800000>Tithe Farm</col>, south of <col=800000>Hosidius</col>. However, the doors were locked. I should try and find a way in.</col>
step	7	16	Finding the body of Betty's uncle
line	<col=000080>At <col=800000>Betty's</col> request, I met her at her uncle's home north west of the <col=800000>Tithe Farm</col>, south of <col=800000>Hosidius</col>. However, upon arrival, we found the <col=800000>Dead Body</col> of her uncle. I should investigate by examining the <col=800000>Body</col>, searching the nearby area for <col=800000>Clues</col>, and questioning potential <col=800000>Witnesses</col>.</col>
step	8	17	After finding enough evidence about Betty's uncle
line	<col=000080>At <col=800000>Betty's</col> request, I met her at her uncle's home north west of the <col=800000>Tithe Farm</col>, south of <col=800000>Hosidius</col>. However, upon arrival, we found the <col=800000>Dead Body</col> of her uncle. I examined the <col=800000>Body</col>, searched the nearby area for <col=800000>Clues</col>, and questioned potential <col=800000>Witnesses</col>. I should now let <col=800000>Betty</col> know what I've learnt.</col>
